{"CDN support is present but not wired through config; GetWebAssets uses a hard-coded empty CDN URL, preventing enabling CDN for assets in tests and at runtime": 0.5925977826118469, "EntryPointAssets struct mutation pattern via SetContentDeliveryURL may not be thread-safe when objects are cached and reused - callers could mutate cached shared instances": 0.5173875093460083, "Global cache entryPointAssetsCache returns a pointer to cached dtos.EntryPointAssets which exposes mutating method SetContentDeliveryURL, creating data race risk in concurrent environment when callers mutate the cached pointer": 0.7784351110458374, "CDN fetch path in readWebAssetsFromCDN uses http.DefaultClient.Do with no explicit timeout, potentially blocking indefinitely if CDN is slow or unresponsive": 0.41792812943458557, "Recovery.go swallows error from GetWebAssets call, hiding CDN/file load failures and reducing observability of outages or misconfigurations": 0.22307643294334412, "TestReadWebassetsFromCDN test is skipped, meaning CDN path behavior is not exercised by tests and could regress without notice": 0.4143655598163605, "CDN URL config flag in defaults.ini may not be properly wired into the code path that fetches assets from CDN": 0.26233235001564026, "Typo in error message: 'asssets-manifest' should be 'assets-manifest'": 0.17826689779758453}